{"data":{"appliedContentFormat":"html","id":"1384933","key":"RCS-28809","fields":{"summary":"Kohl's - Employee Table Not Updating Home Stores","description":"<p>Good Morning,</p><p>The employee table is adding new rows rather than updating the existing row when an associate transfers between stores.  An associate can only have one home store, the value from the most recent file should be used.  The example LP Supervisor below should have one listing for home store 765 only.</p><figure data-type="media-single" data-layout="wide"><div data-type="media" data-media-type="file" data-id="b8638d4d-a878-41c2-85ae-51f1ff09b858" data-alt="image-20260908-111716.png" data-width="1890" data-height="169"></div></figure><p>There are currently 227 associates with multiple home stores listed.  This is causing Work Items to flag in multiple locations unnecessarily.</p><p>Please let me know if something has changed in the way we are sending the employee file that might have caused this.</p><p>Thank you, </p>","status":{"name":"Work in progress","statusCategory":{"name":"In Progress"}},"assignee":{"accountId":"712020:153a3fea-8720-4528-b10f-5196a5d5fb21","displayName":"Enrique Jimenez"},"reporter":{"accountId":"qm:77071153-8149-425d-9cc5-2ef53c35a3bd:67c18952-dd38-454f-b2c1-dad0161cebb4","displayName":"Kyle Kimmerly"},"priority":{"name":"Medium"},"issuetype":{"id":"10102","name":"Incident"},"created":"2026-09-08T07:19:39.063-0400","updated":"2026-10-05T19:41:16.273-0400","labels":[],"subtasks":[],"comment":{"total":9},"issuelinks":[],"customFields":{"Problem":{"id":"customfield_15195","value":{"value":"Data Issue","id":"26295"}},"Severity":{"id":"customfield_15199","value":{"value":"3 - Normal","id":"16560"}},"Product Type":{"id":"customfield_15196","value":{"value":"Secure 5 - EBR","id":"28531"}},"[CHART] Date of First Response":{"id":"customfield_21746","value":"2026-09-08T07:21:11.183-0400"},"Monitor":{"id":"customfield_15191","value":"https://prtg.solutions-sysrepublic.com/"},"Targ